{"id":"d_main_36_03_s","cat":"main","group":{"id":"ch36","label":"Chapter 36 · Betrayal"},"label":"Defibrillator: A","stage":"36-12 STAGE · Start","prev":"d_main_36_02","next":"d_main_36_03_e","speakers":{"leviathan":"Leviathan","rapi_red":"Rapi","grave_p":"Grave","cinderella":"Cinderella"},"icons":{"leviathan":"si_c562_00_s","rapi_red":"si_c016_00_s","grave_p":"si_c514_00_s","cinderella":"si_c511_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_1","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_1","text":"You were trying to manufacture Heretics?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Bog","bgArt":"bog","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_monochrome","movie":null,"shown":["grave_p","cinderella","leviathan","rapi_red"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_2","text":"Yes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_3","text":"When subjected to a particular process, Dark Matter becomes something of a dissolving agent.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_4","text":"If you put something into that new solution, all of the data is absorbed by the Dark Matter.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_5","text":"So if, for example, you combine the data of aerial and subterranean Raptures,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_6","text":"you'll end up with a Rapture that can fly and also burrow into the ground.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_7","text":"Admittedly, it'll only lift about 2 centimeters off the ground and damn near shatter while attempting to burrow, but still.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_8","text":"I discovered that different combinations of data could result in an entirely new creation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_9","text":"So if we're to take that logic one step further...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_10","text":"If a core were to be encased in Dark Matter that contained the combined data of Human imposters and Raptures,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_11","text":"and that became an egg,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_12","text":"what would hatch from it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_13","text":"A fusion of a Nikke and a Rapture... a Heretic.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_14","text":"That's precisely what was running through my mind as I ran those experiments.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_15","text":"I should clarify that while I did take out Raptures, I didn't do the same for imposters.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_16","text":"For them, I only scavenged broken or discarded parts from the dead.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_17","text":"Is that the reason you targeted Cinderella?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_18","text":"... Well. For me, at least.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_19","text":"I thought using the first Heretic as base material might open up new possibilities.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_20","text":"Behemoth didn't feel the same way, however.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_21","text":"She kept calling me \"Anachiro\".","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_22","text":"Yes. Behemoth wanted to join forces with you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_23","text":"She gets lonely easily.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_24","text":"Anyway, it's all over now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_25","text":"We know that we can't beat you, and that you'll never come over to our side.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_26","text":"I'm still open to the second option, if you join us and fight for humankind.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_27","text":"That's why I'm saying it's all over for us. We're already busy simply trying to survive. Why would we put our necks on the line for someone else?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_28","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_28","text":"Were the Four Beasts created through this kind of intermingling?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_29","text":"Didn't I just tell you what the results were?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_30","text":"All of my experiments were a complete failure.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_31","text":"Heretics can't be so easily manufactured, apparently.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_32","text":"All I was ever able to produce were those abominations you saw earlier,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_33","text":"So I stopped.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_34","text":"Then how were you all created, and how did you end up together?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_35","text":"We...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_36","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_37","text":"We don't know where we came from,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_38","text":"but it's clear that we all share a common origin.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_39","text":"Otherwise, we wouldn't feel this inexorable pull toward each other.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_40","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_40","text":"You're like a family.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_41","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_42","text":"Family, you said.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_36_03_s_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_36_03_s_43","text":"Maybe.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}